  "description": "ODUDEW crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: 2(C16 H32 Li1 O4),C168 H130 N16 O2 Yb8,10(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 1 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 1 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 0 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 1 O neighbors; Yb4A (Yb) has 1 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 1 O neighbors; Yb2A (Yb) has 1 O neighbors; Yb3A (Yb) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.794-5.831 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 83.50-174.48°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C240H272I0.40Li2N16O19.60Yb8.",
